<body>
    <h1>Phase 1b (PI20-24) Deliverables</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table class=3D"wrapped relative-table confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 90.=
377%;">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 3.17757%;">
<col style=3D"width: 30.6542%;">
<col style=3D"width: 7.16511%;">
<col style=3D"width: 8.2866%;">
<col style=3D"width: 50.7165%;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Item</th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Capabilities&nbsp;</th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Current Status</th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Completion Date</th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Comments</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">1</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Client Onboarding to IdentityGraph new stack ser=
vices.&nbsp;</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>In Progress</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p><br></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>This is a multi-phase deliverable.&nbsp; We a=
re currently working to onboard 9 clients in PI19.&nbsp; Application-level =
detail for endpoint onboarding can be found <a href=3D"https://att.sharepoi=
nt.com/:x:/r/sites/MPSYSSuiteInternalCollaborationZone/Shared%20Documents/G=
eneral/Modernization/IDGraph%20Endpoint%20Onboarding%20Progress.xlsx?d=3Dwd=
1119c3ec7184b0fb4ddc1e2d11f2601&amp;csf=3D1&amp;web=3D1&amp;e=3D2tzJhw" cla=
ss=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow">here</a>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">2</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Onboard MPS-LDAP clients to CG</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Not Started</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>TBD</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Pending CG development of mS to vend data to =
clients.&nbsp; They did not have capacity to take this on in PI19.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">3</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Continue building IdentityGraph new stack ser=
vices: Convert CDP mS endpoints to IDP mS endpoints.</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>In Progress</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>4/24/2024</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>All new stack mSs are in Production as the 3/=
6 release.&nbsp; Out of 38 total endpoints 22 are complete and 16 will be f=
inished in PI19.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>4</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Continue building IdentityGraph new stack ser=
vices: Convert SOAP APIs to IDP mS endpoints.</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>In Progress</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>PI21</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Out of 54 total SOAP APIs, 7 are already migr=
ated, 30 remain to be migrated (2 are inflight), 8 can be retired, 3 passwo=
rd APIs will be retired when Halo.C absorbs their functionality, 7 will ret=
ire when DSL is retired.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p><br></p>
